Z||000000||Monkeyman||02-25-2000||08:32 PM||||I came out of Wendy's (the restaurant) and noticed a big puddle of oil (I guess) under the car.  I didn't have any oil with me so I thought I could make it 5 or 6 blocks to the gas station to get some.  NOT!!  About a half block from the gas station, it popped and died.  I tried to restart it, but it won't even turn over.  I checked the oil yesterday and it was almost full.  When I checked the oil after whatever happened, there was none showing on the dipstick.<BR>The temp gauge didn't read hot, but the oil pressure gauge read low, but not in the red.<BR>Did I lock it up?  What should I check?  I guess the timing was about right as I just lost my new job today.  (Don't ask.  It's a very depressing story!)  Anybody have any suggestions?||||reg||9
Z||000001||batboy||02-25-2000||08:57 PM||||Something let go. It sounds kind of terminal, but you never know until you look at it. Not turning over and no oil sounds very bad.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||02-25-2000||09:03 PM||||That's kind of what I figured.  At least it didn't catch fire and become a statistic.  Although, as much as I love Fieros, that wouldn't necessarily be the worst thing in the world.  I actually have full coverage insurance on it.  Let's see.  Just where did I put the lighter fluid?  (<B>JUST KIDDING!!!!</B>)  As bad as I felt seeing the burnt hulk on the Fiero in another post, I'd probably cry if anything else happened to the Monkeymobile.  I can't wait to get my GT and get it running.  Then I can retire the Monkeymobile for good.  I'm not sure I could ever use it for parts, though.<P>I just noticed how long winded I'm getting.  Oops.||||reg||1
Z||000003||fierospeeder||02-25-2000||10:09 PM||||Wendy's is totally my favorite fast food &lt;drool&gt; <P>I Hope your fieros engine is okay.  <P>Try taking the belt off, and getting a socket and putting it on the crankshaft pulley, and try turning it with a ratchet.  <BR>I think this is the way to find out if its really bad or not.<BR>If anyone else has ideas.||||reg||1
